#: scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a2ee72f0fa98ebe4f78e5a861324419ce170a93787814547acc59fd52e00592
#. default-sha256: c6c16fe9825519a9081a3c3bd0b980ed544a02e73e68a1e3a8dcfd42f99beeb5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His was a power that evoked images of witches or demons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"the unclean and the impure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dele era um poder que evocava imagens de bruxas ou demônios—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫do obsceno e do impuro."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3210d7352a4ebf5a6ef90e7b5eb4778eacb4875f62e802bce0bdd5c3344ec96f
#. default-sha256: 2c28e07db7ec1c58f1d5e7a3f141efe804dcf6e5e21e61456ba6154578b7ab60
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A mere touch was all it took for him to strip man and beast alike of its life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um mero toque era o suficiente para ele tirar tanto a vida de homens quanto a de feras."

#: scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86584ccc05a3881ee41bb87a4408e6779a299daa7eea37b401712ff5e58bdfe5
#. default-sha256: 0dfadc5d116709a2b0bf4926f04fdb62a3dd4c9d50d35effaf22c69c5161eba7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God has quite a cruel streak to bestow such a power upon such a beautiful young man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Deus tem uma veia bastante cruel para conceder tal poder a um jovem tão bonito."

#: scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e025a10419e3f6baf8e294d2acf787ac9e9d3ccdac8ef0d9ed5af6521661ce6
#. default-sha256: fb49bb4b0908db8b1312d374d61cbe9dc3d9f4bfb1b7281eb35156485bea0fea
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a strange power it was indeed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E de fato era um poder estranho—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫como algo saído de um conto de fadas."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 557f99b085104da0c29b6ea3c27642fedcac9e7e9e374d701ed6febfe9bcef77
#. default-sha256: 239efaaa95caf296eda71bcef9ca992fb6103ce5fa655cf387fb7c43d131395e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Like something confined to words upon the page, it seemed otherworldly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como algo confinado a palavras em uma página, parecia de outro mundo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫inacreditável."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b59aebbfb8336f521b54bb6d5f3785f063e910793da4d5e923da666425648b8
#. default-sha256: 6e69a3c6e0c304a97b7dd516d431bf2be81f1c07c8ebebf18ebc7a4155657735
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, as he had demonstrated to the White-Haired Girl,⟪k:1⟫his peculiar powers were "
"indeed real."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, como ele havia demonstrado para a Garota de Cabelos Brancos,⟪k:1⟫seus poderes "
"peculiares realmente eram reais."

#: scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 718ce64c5641ad05a2707fa2f637bc6288bf8f8ab2e49ba0cbf576828662b090
#. default-sha256: f85412f133f050a71c322da7e7526851e0bc9e1d3994dd180e693c2dda5d65a1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, the world has its fair share of oddities—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dito isso, o mundo tem seu quinhão de esquisitices—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c50abdc221cdb65df8a236f27a4bc03317a153ee4e5cff626b049d0dd65b23f8
#. default-sha256: c02b78e51685c5660dcd22a5c46ea5a180ec6eb4fe274b7d14284b257088bd7c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫it just so happens that those curiosities tend to remain hidden away, known only to a few."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫acontece que essas curiosidades tendem a permanecer escondidas, do conhecimento de poucos."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb57100e892d84d070f6ae004c497355cb198186565e0c0bbaa79c17e6aba660
#. default-sha256: 4c9676cba75a1ec0143f3f23719a33abaf0f52f24059063be6845c0285099ee5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Although, you have laid eyes upon a number of unusual phenomena yourself, "
"Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Embora, você mesmo tenha visto vários fenômenos incomuns, Mestre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47cf90e1572b37d3b2ac85ca4b0d5d09b83d1a8adbb7ed34663b5b310d9de60a
#. default-sha256: 76cd51ed133a0466176475c0cc55057007d5bd5ee84226ef7e0f4371a6723e11
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The doors to the past through which we have passed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This very mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫As portas para o passado pelas quais passamos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esta mansão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa27873593c20aeede532bbfd6e80c815c7058aaf46af7ecae0cb0c5191f2504
#. default-sha256: 8418a7b717b2de0d2e7bdeb3c6b20002397eb5ea4ba6a49cf5299772a09462c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And, as a matter of fact, the two of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E, na verdade, nós dois."

#: scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68f7c92dfac8ad58b12afaa55633123941c4dd6eb60ef196e3e48ad3450859f4
#. default-sha256: 949518253b15bfac94bfb2f2675e6dd998727a1bd4fdc7b99a6d40ea1568488e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as you just saw, the White-Haired Girl found herself enraptured with this man and his "
"accursed power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agora, como você acabou de ver, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos se viu arrebatada por este homem "
"e seu poder amaldiçoado."

#: scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7398ed923e5ecc0bcabf8f47b71c1f21b8cbc3f003057ae4ef5ddf3e9e63464d
#. default-sha256: 2460aa59abccb50cce4634169623ae1439ac8dfb8f08c340abed196c1dd87334
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How do you think Michel acted in response to her proclamation?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Como você acha que Michel agiu em resposta à declaração dela?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f76d4b7d6b86ff7f2b0a429f8c741960370c51fc1e295dd2449f89bfc3c3080a
#. default-sha256: d1e838b945ce5470962123b708c80ea145e8db1e502542877a6383b5a7d9f4cc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had spent so long refusing to interact with others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫unable⟪k:4⟫ to "
"interact with them. ⟪k:5⟫As such, he was unsure how to respond."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele passou tanto tempo se recusando a interagir com os outros—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫não,⟪k:3⟫"
"incapaz⟪k:4⟫ de interagir. ⟪k:5⟫Como tal, ele não tinha certeza de como responder."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5a477be5f3f8f4344ed2c2129a4d2f78f5235e77aef3d5aac33a79fadee3357
#. default-sha256: 21458ccd3b202e002de217d18eea2e3b0486c094887ed4b787b5ba23f8fd5553
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After standing there expressionless for a few moments, he muttered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Depois de ficar ali inexpressivo por alguns momentos, ele murmurou:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa1e7db32653d6bf39016f44f00a023f31dad4f1cdb0ea9fb4f80727aac33a58
#. default-sha256: 79175e538b6b41e8eebb9ea7254f921ae40637a805150dcc5afca9994c095a7f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll consider it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vou considerar."

#: scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2692a8bf4eb40c160af8785ca73e3b82f280b8c7a268cce87d6eab2dd7e4556e
#. default-sha256: 47dd25076d9c7f45da39e4fe40b5082bb6d0299962c7b5bf7c7a355707325af9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And with that, he returned to his chambers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E com isso, voltou para seus aposentos."

#: scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a85f4f611d9151fd7728ade6c269e15a11ae05927e65880f2931cd1f8b5a62
#. default-sha256: c7d09454c3af8b3564368d73f1cf4b141a9d6d5f7c8cbd741ac165337dbb772c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he was not someone who wore his heart on his sleeve,⟪k:1⟫I personally do not believe "
"he was completely devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora ele não fosse alguém que trouxesse o coração exposto,⟪k:1⟫eu, pessoalmente, não "
"acredito que ele fosse completamente desprovido de emoções."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a2bbe84d7f981913fbfe81207e322b6e693ba6fba5373c61ebeafc64e19463d
#. default-sha256: 4707bb4ecace729d8db4eeb60fd1f64b79e7f5c2b49b3289b92f5097fae988ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had simply forgotten how to express them in his extended solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Simplesmente havia esquecido como expressá-las em sua prolongada solidão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 082f37430c87b108a6c1766523c6646ea44f0e98ff7d2cd8060e8aae99dbd51d
#. default-sha256: 9107f5bc0dfb171a63d9e4fa3fcd0581469760312aec7d7cb14d9cb79ce4185d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I think he was, in that moment, in a state of complete panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então eu acho que ele estava, naquele momento, em estado de completo pânico."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 045e361b3876753239a1da84ff6db2d0cab1f751832dd7e93eea2f3d814e3222
#. default-sha256: b20df0d8e885fb71a4ff2f2e5c76cc86d3187ab30009aa2eb2839c781b26b4bf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, just assaulted him with a stream of incomprehensible declarations:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Afinal, ela acabara de investir contra ele com uma torrente de declarações incompreensíveis:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3d131ced0a6902c22e2835f5bd2693cc5dce2ab4fba026dc7034b35424483be
#. default-sha256: 829c9695459a5bd16994c76710004a20f615a062e00e6ccdd670d5eab40da3a7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that, knowing the truth, she still wished to remain in the mansion..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫que, sabendo da verdade, ela ainda desejava permanecer na mansão..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9798875004a91ea6c75fa0d674aedc3ed4668d2b7b3ccee1fe1fc8762231c182
#. default-sha256: eacbceff013db3c2e6f77074eab5838b2ffd75295356d8b7d99a811c782ab039
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and that, knowing the truth, she loved him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e que, sabendo da verdade, o amava."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bffd65033e25d51b629d4cbe2d2163426d1bd540b9687ee2703df34c21fe6658
#. default-sha256: 73db11ee556bddf943a0063c53d315d6554275957a88c92013e4a39d5fad8003
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The love she had declared for Michel was not a fleeting puppy love;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫there was "
"genuine tenderness and warmth to her words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O amor que ela havia declarado por Michel não era uma paixão infantil e fugaz;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"havia ternura e calor genuínos em suas palavras."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a20c782bd8d07c19df48449b7cd37acfbab231cc191def42b8cd36eced81071
#. default-sha256: c1bb2c53f859f281c561b38fdd9e9dbba769f9203a5ea117f486600922df2826
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had gone through his life shunned, feared, pushed away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To him, that was "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas ele passou a vida sendo evitado, temido, afastado.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Para ele, isso era normal."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 946fbbaf658809b4a17cd257d057a29f39fbac1bef2ff82937e896af94d0d55d
#. default-sha256: 043de21da4e3d995d04376a44dbdbd14e6952c63b09d72f3cf2bf59db4b12edf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never given anyone reason to have any fondness for him,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nunca tinha dado a ninguém razão para ter qualquer carinho por ele,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b83d6b716bb50d4077110f3997ba5bcf7c64cd1cf01c521d3c0e734d9d4759a6
#. default-sha256: 5469b7fb43863f0e3a6bbfa2cd6ccd852f355e28deb5867ef974d64cd1a61d68
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so he found himself utterly unsure how to take the affection she was showing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫então se viu totalmente inseguro sobre como aceitar a afeição que ela estava demonstrando."

#: scenario4:scenario4_94244513_6F40_479B_846A_CA55E3986713
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28aecd0e7d608f6ab000378335f3d2d1f43594a29e90df8e6de2e84113962182
#. default-sha256: 0997880b6461a8852bc045a4af7e5a4c55802b046a16bfa33b711268a6a1ca88
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94244513_6F40_479B_846A_CA55E3986713"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course... ⟪k:1⟫he was not the only one rattled by the whole affair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫É claro...⟪k:1⟫ele não foi o único abalado por todo o caso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F2BD1EAC_2F55_47F8_8461_C52B49B7724E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
